I want to use the `Launcher` to implement [Test: Use Launcher to Start the ILIAS Test
](https://docu.ilias.de/goto_docu_wiki_wpage_979_1357.html), but I noticed that the data mapping for the inputs of the `Launcher` form is not stable. As of now, it is unclear which value belongs to which input. The values are stored in a numeric array where the keys correspond to the order of the inputs inside the form. This makes it difficult to maintain.

Therefore, I propose this improvement, which allows the values to be mapped to the input names.

